UnitVelodromeMigration::Constructor
├── when the owner is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
├── when the deployer is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the v2 token is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the v2 voting escrow is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the v2 voter is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the migration opening timestamp is not week aligned
│   └── it should revert with InvalidOpen
├── when the migration opening timestamp is not in the future
│   └── it should revert with InvalidOpen
├── when the Hyperlane mailbox is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the root domain is zero
│   └── it should revert with InvalidDomain
├── when the root domain is equal to the mailbox local domain
│   └── it should revert with InvalidDomain
├── when the legacy root voting rewards factory is the zero address
